  "query_preview": "..\n(Monday night through next Saturday)\nIssued at 1015 PM CDT Sat Aug 29 2026\n\nA zonal ridge axis remains parked over the region through late \nweek at which time the upper high (previously over the mid- \nMississippi Valley) retrogrades across the southern plains and \nlingers near West TX by next weekend. This spells no end to the \nongoing heat and drought as high temps continue to run 6-12 \ndegrees over climo. A few ensembles drag the high center to our \nwest by next weekend which could support some storms similar to \nwhat we saw this past week, but this appears too unlikely at this \ntime.",
